```text
Internet
   |
   v
Public Load Balancer
   |
   v
Web VM (Linux)
10.0.1.4
   |
   | TCP 3306
   v
DB VM (Linux + MySQL)
10.0.2.4

Web VM
   |
   | Private Endpoint
   v
Azure Blob Storage

Administration:
Azure Bastion
   |
