## Key Things Learned

* Designing a VNet with separate Web, DB, Private Endpoint, and Bastion subnets
* Using NSGs to control traffic between tiers
* Hosting a web server on a private Linux VM behind a Load Balancer
* Connecting a Web VM to a private MySQL server
* Using Private Endpoint for Blob Storage
* Using Managed Identity and RBAC instead of storage access keys
* Using Azure Bastion for private VM administration
* Collecting VM performance data with Azure Monitor and Log Analytics
* Checking Azure resource costs with Cost Management

